[EXPLAIN] Applicability Domain
~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~~
  The Isolation Forest learns the 'normal' region of chemical space covered by the 859 training
  molecules.         By construction about 5% of the training molecules themselves sit at the edge
  and are treated         as outliers. Any FDA drug that falls outside this region is excluded
  below, because the model would be extrapolating.
